{"4132610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DeGen Rivals", "steam_appid": 4132610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/bd3cf465e344007be779f07c0d15d22f.avif?t=1773402345\" width=1245 height=369 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/82b06efd53a47f41f003a5dc60580903.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/82b06efd53a47f41f003a5dc60580903.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/82b06efd53a47f41f003a5dc60580903.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a universe created by the “Dr.”, a mad scientist whose crazy DNA experiments created the ultimate DeGens from a mix of traits extracted from whatever he could get his hands on. His experiment has gone off the rails, and now the DeGens are on a rampage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/2aa9d35b52c6e7c6f1311b0b676bfafe.avif?t=1773402345\" width=1377 height=419 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/29a6e72534971a69d4794319a38fc1f0.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/29a6e72534971a69d4794319a38fc1f0.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/29a6e72534971a69d4794319a38fc1f0.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out with the DeGens in fast-paced casual matches for domination using blasters, a variety of crazy Power-ups, and your own vehicle as you weaponize the physics to crash, bash, and smash your Rivals to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/4bfd8e99c15375314f456be767a11349.avif?t=1773402345\" width=1275 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreck your rivals, outrun “The Crush”, and be the last kart rolling in the core Battle Royale mode. Test your tactics in Demolition Party objective-based gamemodes like “Cops n' Robbers”, “Loot Smash”, and “Order Up!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/9f9b510f11cf13b5cfd63c7834b3de27.avif?t=1773402345\" width=1269 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the beatdowns, DeGenerate your own unique avatar in the Lab and trick out your ride in the Garage with infinite combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MODES OF CHAOS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash rivals in quickplay or host private lobbies across a variety of chaotic game modes and levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMASH CASH REWARDS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Daily Quests to earn Smash Cash, level up, and unlock exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUILDS &amp; GLORY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a Guild, climb the leaderboards, and compete for dominance in Seasonal Tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROSS-PLATFORM BATTLE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight friends or rivals on PC and Mobile in seamless online lobbies.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/bd3cf465e344007be779f07c0d15d22f.avif?t=1773402345\" width=1245 height=369 /