ns in fast-paced casual matches for domination using blasters, a variety of crazy Power-ups, and your own vehicle as you weaponize the physics to crash, bash, and smash your Rivals to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/4bfd8e99c15375314f456be767a11349.avif?t=1773402345\" width=1275 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wreck your rivals, outrun “The Crush”, and be the last kart rolling in the core Battle Royale mode. Test your tactics in Demolition Party objective-based gamemodes like “Cops n' Robbers”, “Loot Smash”, and “Order Up!”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/9f9b510f11cf13b5cfd63c7834b3de27.avif?t=1773402345\" width=1269 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=954 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the beatdowns, DeGenerate your own unique avatar in the Lab and trick out your ride in the Garage with infinite combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MODES OF CHAOS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash rivals in quickplay or host private lobbies across a variety of chaotic game modes and levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMASH CASH REWARDS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Daily Quests to earn Smash Cash, level up, and unlock exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUILDS &amp; GLORY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a Guild, climb the leaderboards, and compete for dominance in Seasonal Tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CROSS-PLATFORM BATTLE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight friends or rivals on PC and Mobile in seamless online lobbies.</p>", "short_description": "The ultimate Kart-based Battle Royale. Smash your Rivals in free-to-play, 8-player online chaos across a variety of wild levels and arcade game modes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/7880a90117ecc32cc9914b7e4bbf40bc65a392f5/header.jpg?t=1773402345", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/bde2d16b94a0e5c197bc3f